 this gun control bill- and he is a Republican.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We all agree that there should be some form of gun control, but we disagree strongly about how much.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In addition to objecting to the 10 round magazine idiocy, I strongly object to the way the law was passed - rushed through late at night with no discussion, with no chance for a rational examination. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Where is the due process?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I too will be voting in November. This needs to be a campaign issue.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/2369058223791314156/comments/default/7819971120513884699'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/2369058223791314156/comments/default/7819971120513884699'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2014/02/an-open-letter-to-men-and-women-of.html?showComment=1394572461402#c7819971120513884699' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2014/02/an-open-letter-to-men-and-women-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-2369058223791314156' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/2369058223791314156' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1280496126"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 11, 2014 at 4:14 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-595453669746195468</id><published>2014-03-11T12:50:22.383-05:00</published><updated>2014-03-11T12:50:22.383-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Great letter!I do believe you are the &amp;#39;Patrick...</titl